{"id":"vod_bf_28191","vodId":"28191","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"人马小姐不迷茫","name_cn":"人马小姐不迷茫","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-29/529cd4176c6b749f2e551f7a1161e260.jpg"},"summary":"君原姬乃（深川芹亚 配音）是一个个性十分温柔和蔼的平凡高中女孩，然而，和其他女高中生不一样的是，姬乃是拥有一半人类身体和一半马的身体的半人马族。虽然过着和普通人类一样的生活，但实际上，姬乃对自己独特而又庞大的体型十分的在意和苦恼。　　大大咧咧开朗活泼的龙人狱乐希（桑原由气 配音）、成熟稳重总在关键时刻扮演军师角色的角人名乐羌子（白石晴香 配音）、天生就拥有着领导的气魄的翼人御魂真奈美（镰仓有那 配音）、理性沉稳的南极蛇人萨斯萨斯索（绫濑悠 配音），这些半兽人们都是姬乃的同班同学，每天，她们都聚在一起，过着充满了快乐的校园生活。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 05:45:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/renmaxiaojiebumimang/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/renmaxiaojiebumimang/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/renmaxiaojiebumimang/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/renmaxiaojiebumimang/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/renmaxiaojiebumimang/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/renmaxiaojiebumimang/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/renmaxiaojiebumimang/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/renmaxiaojiebumimang/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/renmaxiaojiebumimang/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/renmaxiaojiebumimang/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/renmaxiaojiebumimang/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/renmaxiaojiebumimang/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:49.136Z"}